OL,3,ASouthport killer faces trial for
OL,4,Aalleged prison attacks
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe has been charged with attempted
OL,7,Fgrievous bodily harm of a prison
OL,8,Fofficer, two other assaults of officers
OL,9,Fand possession of a knife or other
OL,10,Foffensive weapon across separate dates
OL,11,Flast year at HMP Belmarsh, south
OL,12,FLondon.
OL,14,FRudakubana was not asked to enter any
OL,15,Fpleas and a preliminary hearing has
OL,16,Fbeen set for 5 February, with a
OL,17,Fprovisional trial date of 8 October
OL,18,F2027.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
